==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|носи́ть|-ся}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|носи́ться}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-носиться.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|носи́ться|impf}}

# to [[rush]], to [[rush]] around, to run/drive around (on a high speed)
# to [[float]] around, to fly around
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[fuss]] over, to pay too much [[attention]] to, to be [[obsessed]] with (an [[idea]])
# (of smells, sounds, etc.) to [[spread]]
# to [[wear]], to be worn (of clothes)
#: {{ux|ru|[[это|Э́то]] [[пла́тье]] [[хорошо́]] [[но́сится]].|This dress wears well.}}
# {{infl of|ru|носи́ть||pass}}

====Usage notes====
{{U:sla:directional verb|ru|multi|impf=носи́ться|othimpf=нести́сь}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf|4c|носи́ться}}

====Derived terms====
